es that value to `rd`. `:resume` is the exception: it transfers\n461:`:current-continuation` can save a register body's state. Some registers\n493:      :store-get rd _          def {rd}\n496:      :stream-make rd _        def {rd}\n502:      :current-continuation rd _                   def {rd}\n504:      :resume _ v               use {v}\n515:      :return, :halt, :resume, tail :call   {}\n548:1. `:live-shape`: `live` is a vector of nonnegative integers in strictly\n552:3. `:live-tail`: when a `:call` is tail, `live` is `[]`.\n553:4. `:live-exact`: `live` equals `body-liveness`'s own answer for that pc,\n574:    :vm/store-get                 [:store-get rd key]\n577:    :stream/make                  [:stream-make rd buffer]\n588:    :vm/current-continuation      [:current-continuation rd live]\n591:                                  [:resume parked-id rv]\n599:`:resume` ignores that supplied target because successful resume abandons\n602:`:resume` as a terminator. Missing parked ids and format mismatches are\n608:`:current-continuation`, and `:park`. No allocator free-list state enters\n687:    effect-descriptor  instruction registers -> effect | nil\n688:    continuation-payload runtime instruction -> payload\n689:    continuation-defect payload -> defect | nil\n690:    wait-entry-defect entry -> defect | nil\n701:    :store-get         read state store; write rd\n704:    :stream-make       {:effect :stream/make, :capacity capacity}\n715:    :current-continuation  produce a reified continuation value\n717:    :resume            engine/resume-continuation\n719:`:stream-make`, `:stream-cursor`, and `:stream-close` are nonblocking under\n729:effect, the payload uses `:resume-mode :return-result`; it preserves no\n732:`:resume-mode :write-result` and its call destination.\n755:     :resume-mode :write-result | :return-result\n782:`:current-continuation` constructs\n817:For `:resume-mode :write-result`, restore creates a register vector of the\n828:An arbitrary value passed to `:resume`, including an error-shaped value, is\n831:resume value: restore refuses it with `:resume-value` before changing the\n933:   cross-body targets, and a nonterminal `:resume`, with named diagnostics.\n943:   cover current-continuation, explicit park/resume, non-tail and tail\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
